---
/**
 * @category Pricing
 * @theme starquix
 * @name Pricing2
 */
---
<section class='bg-stone-50 px-4 py-20 md:px-10 md:py-28 xl:px-16 xl:py-32 dark:bg-stone-900'>
  <div class='flex flex-col gap-12 md:gap-16'>
    <div class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-end md:gap-10'>
      <h2 class='m-0 font-sans text-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.04em] text-stone-900 text-balance md:col-span-7 md:text-6xl xl:text-[4rem] dark:text-stone-50'>Porovnat bedýnky</h2>
      <p class='m-0 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-600 text-pretty md:col-span-5 dark:text-stone-400'>Všechny nabídky obsahují celý editor a export běžných souborů Astro. Liší se jen těmito limity.</p>
    </div>
    <div role='table' aria-label='Plan comparison' class='grid grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.4fr)_repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))]'>
      <div role='row' class='col-span-3 grid grid-cols-subgrid md:col-span-4'>
        <p role='cell' class='col-span-3 m-0 pb-4 font-sans text-sm leading-normal text-stone-500 md:col-span-1 md:max-w-[16rem] md:pb-0 md:pr-6 md:pt-6 dark:text-stone-400'>Ceny v korunách za měsíc. Zrušit můžete kdykoli.</p>
        <div role='columnheader' class='flex flex-col gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-transparent px-2 py-4 md:px-5 md:py-6'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Snídaně</h3>
          <p class='m-0 flex items-baseline gap-0.5 font-sans font-light text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'><span class='text-xl md:text-2xl'>$</span><span class='text-5xl tracking-[-0.05em] md:text-6xl xl:text-7xl'>0</span></p>
          <a href='#' class='inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-stone-200 px-2 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-stone-300 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:bg-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-600 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50'>Začít zdarma</a>
        </div>
        <div role='columnheader' class='flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-solid border-stone-200 bg-white px-2 py-4 md:rounded-b-none md:border-b-0 md:px-5 md:py-6 dark:border-stone-700 dark:bg-stone-800'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Dort</h3>
          <p class='m-0 flex items-baseline gap-0.5 font-sans font-light text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'><span class='text-xl md:text-2xl'>$</span><span class='text-5xl tracking-[-0.05em] md:text-6xl xl:text-7xl'>12</span></p>
          <a href='#' class='inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-yellow-400 px-2 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-yellow-500 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:focus-visible:outline-yellow-400'>Objednat dort</a>
        </div>
        <div role='columnheader' class='flex flex-col gap-4 border-0 border-t border-solid border-transparent px-2 py-4 md:px-5 md:py-6'>
          <h3 class='m-0 font-sans text-lg font-semibold text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'>Tým</h3>
          <p class='m-0 flex items-baseline gap-0.5 font-sans font-light text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50'><span class='text-xl md:text-2xl'>$</span><span class='text-5xl tracking-[-0.05em] md:text-6xl xl:text-7xl'>39</span></p>
          <a href='#' class='inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-stone-200 px-2 font-sans text-base font-semibold text-stone-900 no-underline transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-stone-300 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-stone-900 dark:bg-stone-700 dark:text-stone-50 dark:hover:bg-stone-600 dark:focus-visible:outline-stone-50'>Objednat stůl</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div role='row' class='col-span-3 grid grid-cols-subgrid border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 md:col-span-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <p role='rowheader' class='col-span-3 m-0 pt-4 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 md:col-span-1 md:py-4 md:text-base dark:text-stone-400'>Weby</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>1</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 border-0 border-x border-solid border-transparent md:border-stone-200 md:bg-white md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50 md:dark:border-stone-700 md:dark:bg-stone-800'>Neomezeně</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>Neomezeně</p>
      </div>
      <div role='row' class='col-span-3 grid grid-cols-subgrid border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 md:col-span-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <p role='rowheader' class='col-span-3 m-0 pt-4 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 md:col-span-1 md:py-4 md:text-base dark:text-stone-400'>Rozvoz po městě</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>Žádné</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 border-0 border-x border-solid border-transparent md:border-stone-200 md:bg-white md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50 md:dark:border-stone-700 md:dark:bg-stone-800'>Neomezeně</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>Neomezeně</p>
      </div>
      <div role='row' class='col-span-3 grid grid-cols-subgrid border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 md:col-span-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <p role='rowheader' class='col-span-3 m-0 pt-4 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 md:col-span-1 md:py-4 md:text-base dark:text-stone-400'>Historie verzí</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>7 dní</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 border-0 border-x border-solid border-transparent md:border-stone-200 md:bg-white md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50 md:dark:border-stone-700 md:dark:bg-stone-800'>90 dní</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>Celá historie objednávek</p>
      </div>
      <div role='row' class='col-span-3 grid grid-cols-subgrid border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 md:col-span-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <p role='rowheader' class='col-span-3 m-0 pt-4 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 md:col-span-1 md:py-4 md:text-base dark:text-stone-400'>Pekaři</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>Pro jednoho</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 border-0 border-x border-solid border-transparent md:border-stone-200 md:bg-white md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50 md:dark:border-stone-700 md:dark:bg-stone-800'>Pro jednoho</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>Až 10</p>
      </div>
      <div role='row' class='col-span-3 grid grid-cols-subgrid border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 md:col-span-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <p role='rowheader' class='col-span-3 m-0 pt-4 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 md:col-span-1 md:py-4 md:text-base dark:text-stone-400'>Objednávky za měsíc</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>100</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 border-0 border-x border-solid border-transparent md:border-stone-200 md:bg-white md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50 md:dark:border-stone-700 md:dark:bg-stone-800'>2,000</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>10,000</p>
      </div>
      <div role='row' class='col-span-3 grid grid-cols-subgrid border-0 border-t border-solid border-stone-200 md:col-span-4 dark:border-stone-700'>
        <p role='rowheader' class='col-span-3 m-0 pt-4 font-sans text-sm text-stone-600 md:col-span-1 md:py-4 md:text-base dark:text-stone-400'>Podpora</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>Sousedé</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 border-0 border-x border-solid border-transparent md:rounded-b-2xl md:border-b md:border-stone-200 md:bg-white md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50 md:dark:border-stone-700 md:dark:bg-stone-800'>E-mail</p>
        <p role='cell' class='m-0 px-2 pb-4 pt-1 font-sans text-base text-stone-900 md:px-5 md:py-4 dark:text-stone-50'>Přednost</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
